{"title": "Manipur Naga Village Attacked, Houses Torched in Kangpokpi District", "summary": "Armed individuals attacked a Naga village in Manipur's Kangpokpi district, setting fire to nine houses. The incident involved multiple rounds of firing before the houses were torched. The violence occurred in a Naga village within the Kangpokpi district.", "summary_points": ["Armed individuals attacked a Naga village in Manipur's Kangpokpi district.", "Nine houses were set on fire during the attack.", "The attack involved multiple rounds of firing.", "The incident took place in a Naga village within the Kangpokpi district."], "title_hi": "मणिपुर के नागा गांव पर हमला, कांगपोकपी जिले में घरों को फूंका गया", "summary_hi": "हथियारबंद लोगों ने मणिपुर के कांगपोकपी जिले में एक नागा गांव पर हमला कर नौ घरों में आग लगा दी। इस घटना में घरों को आग लगाने से पहले कई राउंड फायरिंग हुई। यह हिंसा कांगपोकपी जिले के एक नागा गांव में हुई।", "summary_points_hi": ["हथियारबंद लोगों ने मणिपुर के कांगपोकपी जिले में एक नागा गांव पर हमला किया।", "हमले के दौरान नौ घरों में आग लगा दी गई।", "हमले में कई राउंड फायरिंग शामिल थी।", "यह घटना कांगपोकपी जिले के एक नागा गांव में हुई।"], "framing": {"left": ["Reported the escalation of violence in Manipur with armed men attacking a Naga village and torching homes."], "center": ["Stated that armed miscreants attacked a Naga village in Manipur's Kangpokpi district.", "Reported that nine houses were burnt down following several rounds of firing.", "Focused on the specific location of the attack in Kangpokpi district."], "right": ["Described the incident as fresh violence in Manipur's Kangpokpi district.", "Emphasized that armed miscreants torched several Naga houses."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["मणिपुर में हिंसा बढ़ने की सूचना दी, जिसमें हथियारबंद लोगों ने एक नागा गांव पर हमला कर घरों को फूंका।"], "center": ["बताया कि हथियारबंद बदमाशों ने मणिपुर के कांगपोकपी जिले में एक नागा गांव पर हमला किया।", "सूचना दी कि कई राउंड फायरिंग के बाद नौ घरों को जला दिया गया।", "कांगप